    "Koidrive" : {},
    "Koidrive applied what this Mac had not changed and moved the files it removed to the local trash." : {},
    "Koidrive asks here when it needs a decision, such as before deleting many files." : {},
    "Koidrive can only apply changes safely where the file system can rename without replacing. Move the folder to your Mac's disk." : {},
    "Koidrive can't reach the server, so it can't tell whether another device is still signed in, and the server keeps this Mac listed until another device removes it. If this Mac is the last one, after it signs out you can't sign back in from the Koidrive app. Getting back in needs the owner recovery steps from the deployment guide, run outside the app with administrator access to the server's deployment." : {},
    "Koidrive can't save its sync state" : {},
    "Koidrive can't start" : {},
    "Koidrive couldn't save this change, so it wasn't made: %@" : {},
    "Koidrive is an independent project and is not affiliated with Cloudflare, Inc." : {},
    "Koidrive is holding these deletions instead of sending them, because they would make %@: %@ removing %@ from a folder of %@. Other changes keep syncing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Koidrive is holding these deletions instead of sending them, because they would make %1$@: %2$@ removing %3$@ from a folder of %4$@. Other changes keep syncing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
